{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1840393616600043861","created_at":"2024-09-29T14:10:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1840393616600043861"],"id":"1840393616600043861","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":110853,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1825484077069135935","type":"quoted"}],"text":"那些说我不清不楚的看客，8.19约过小鲜肉，之后没再约。然后8.21凌晨我来大姨妈。所以，你觉得我清楚不清楚呢？\n\n只是因为我和他分居，他也不记我来大姨妈的时间窗口，所以有了推辞的理由。 https://t.co/FEmZfws9Xk https://t.co/3qLWgowbnF","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1840393616600043861"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1840390195419516974","created_at":"2024-09-29T13:56:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1840390195419516974"],"id":"1840390195419516974","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":144866,"like_count":213,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":56,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我就今晚住院，明天回家了。跟家里人说我子宫长了息肉，要出来做手术切掉。的确我是来拿掉不该存在的东西。\n\n但刚才老人家打电话来说小孩子今天突然发烧38.3。我在想是不是小家伙感受到了某种心灵感应。\n\n要赶紧回家照顾孩子，养好身体，应对工作和考试。\n\n这就是你们的C","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1840390195419516974"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1840300395718951373","created_at":"2024-09-29T07:59:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1840300395718951373"],"id":"1840300395718951373","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":94822,"like_count":64,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1840299499270324360","type":"quoted"}],"text":"再者，以大G的性格，如果真的不是他的，你们觉得，他还会陪我来医院？他还不把祖宗十八代翻出来挂网？\n\n居然还有人教育我出去记得戴套，那我也教育你上网记得带脑子。\n\n不过，还好决定不要了。大G今时今日这种精神状态，他的种绝对不会好到哪里去…他这两年应该是被人下蛊或者夺舍了 https://t.co/BWBQ73KA9Q","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1840300395718951373"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1840299499270324360","created_at":"2024-09-29T07:56:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1840299499270324360"],"id":"1840299499270324360","lang":"zh","pu